  abilityName: Mercury Retrograde
  abilityDesc: 20 combo Dark attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    10 combo Dark attack on single foe, boosts all elemental damage for 3 turns,
    probable 3 turns critical and elemental vulnerability infliction, may activate
    BB/SBB/UBB twice for 3 turns, may raises allies from KO
